---
import { FAQ_ITEMS, formatCurrencyHumanName, POPULAR_SWAP_PAIRS } from '../../lib/exchange/swapPageInfo'
import { buildSwapUrl } from '../../lib/exchange/swapUrls'
import Markdown from '../Markdown.astro'
---

<section class="mt-12 space-y-10 border-t border-night-700/50 pt-8 text-sm text-day-400">
  <div>
    <h2 class="font-title text-base font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-day-200 uppercase">
      Frequently asked questions
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
      {
        FAQ_ITEMS.map(({ id, q, a }) => (
          <details
            id={id}
            class="group scroll-mt-24 rounded-lg border border-night-700/60 bg-night-800/30 px-4 py-3"
          >
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-day-200 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
              <span class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <span class="font-medium">{q}</span>
                <span class="text-day-600 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-day-400 [&_a]:text-day-200 [&_a]:underline [&_a]:decoration-dotted [&_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&_a]:text-green-300">
              <Markdown content={a} />
            </div>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
    <h2 class="font-title text-base font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-day-200 uppercase">
      Why compare KYC-free swaps on KYCnot.me
    </h2>
    <p>
      In a world where your identity is predated by everyone, KYC-free swaps let you exchange one
      cryptocurrency for another without handing over your ID, selfie, or proof of address.
    </p>
    <p>
      Rates can differ a lot between providers, even on the same pair, and they move fast. This page pulls
      live quotes together so you do not have to open ten tabs just to find out who is currently giving the
      best deal. We only integrate providers that publicly offer no-KYC swaps and have a working backend
      integration. You can click on any provider quote to see some quick info about KYC practices and other
      details. If you want to see more, just visit the service's full profile.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not take custody of your funds and we do not add extra fees on top of the provider's quote. When
      you click through, the swap happens with that provider, not with KYCnot.me. Some partners pay us a
      referral fee out of their own margin, which does not change what you receive and helps us maintain this
      site.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h2 class="font-title text-base font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-day-200 uppercase">
      Popular swap pairs
    </h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4">
      {
        POPULAR_SWAP_PAIRS.map(({ from, to }) => (
          <li>
            <a
              href={buildSwapUrl(from, to)}
              class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1 rounded-sm hover:text-green-300"
            >
              {formatCurrencyHumanName(from)}
              <span class="text-day-600">to</span>
              {formatCurrencyHumanName(to)}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
